# React / Next.js (`apps/web`)

- Route files stay named `page.tsx`, `layout.tsx`; import from `app/_features/<name>/PageName.tsx` or `app/_app/`.
- Components: `PascalCase.tsx`. Styled modules: `styles/camelCase.ts`.
- `const Component = (props: Props): ReactElement => { const { x } = props; ... }`
- `interface Props` for component props.
- See `apps/web/AGENTS.md` for Next.js 16 notes when using App Router APIs.
